ss="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Atherosclerotic Cardiovascular Disease Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80">Atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease (ASCVD) happens when plaque builds up within the walls of someone’s arteries. It encompasses several different conditions, including:<br/>Coronary heart disease (CHD) (e.g., myocardial infarction, coronary artery stenosis, angina)<br/>Cerebrovascular disease (e.g., ischemic stroke, transient ischemic attack, and carotid artery stenosis)<br/>Peripheral artery disease (e.g., claudication)<br/>Aortic atherosclerotic disease (e.g., descending thoracic aneurysm)</p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" id="Coronary-Heart-Disease-Risk" class="markers-modules_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-top"><div class="markers-modules_tab-section-tag">Health Risks</div><div class="text-size-tiny text-weight-semibold text-color-light-green">Based on face-scan and user input</div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Coronary Heart Disease Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80"></p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" id="Stroke-Risk" class="markers-modules_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-top"><div class="markers-modules_tab-section-tag">Health Risks</div><div class="text-size-tiny text-weight-semibold text-color-light-green">Based on face-scan and user input</div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Stroke Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80"></p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 5" id="Heart-Failure-Risk" class="markers-modules_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-top"><div class="markers-modules_tab-section-tag">Health Risks</div><div class="text-size-tiny text-weight-semibold text-color-light-green">Based on face-scan and user input</div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Heart Failure Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80"></p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 6" id="Peripheral-Vascular-Disease-Risk" class="markers-modules_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-top"><div class="markers-modules_tab-section-tag">Health Risks</div><div class="text-size-tiny text-weight-semibold text-color-light-green">Based on face-scan and user input</div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Peripheral Vascular Disease Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80"></p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 7" id="Cardiovascular-Event-Risk-2" class="markers-modules_tab-pane w-tab-pane"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content"><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-top"><div class="markers-modules_tab-section-tag">Health Risks</div><div class="text-size-tiny text-weight-semibold text-color-light-green">Based on face-scan and user input</div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-mid"><div class="heading-style-h4 text-weight-medium">Cardiovascular Event Risk</div><p class="text-size-regular opacity-80"></p></div><div class="markers-modules_tab-content-graphic-wrapper"></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 8